{"4461800": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Mom Life Simulator", "steam_appid": 4461800, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong>Step into the daily routine of a loving but incredibly busy mother in Mom Life Simulator. Every day is a balance between caring for your family, keeping the house in order, and trying to find a little time for yourself. <br> <br>From morning chaos to quiet evening moments, your ability to manage time and priorities will determine how smoothly the day goes. <br> <br>👩‍👧‍👦 Life as a Mom<br>Experience the everyday challenges of managing a household and caring for your family. Every day brings new responsibilities and unexpected situations that require planning and quick decisions. <br> <br>🧒 Two Children, Different Needs<br>Take care of your school-aged child by preparing them for the day and helping with their routine, while also looking after your baby to make sure they stay happy and comfortable. <br> <br>🧹 Household Responsibilities<br>Keep the home running smoothly by completing everyday tasks like cleaning, doing laundry, and cooking meals. The faster and more efficiently you work, the more time you’ll have for other activities. <br> <br>🐶 Pet Care<br>Your dog is also part of the family. Play with it, give it attention, and make sure it stays happy and cared for. <br> <br>🎨 Time for Yourself<br>Even the busiest moms need a break. Spend some time on hobbies to relax, recharge, and maintain a healthy balance between responsibilities and personal life. <br> <br>⏱ Balance &amp; Time Management<br>The real challenge is managing everything at once. Plan your day carefully, prioritize tasks, and make sure no one in the family feels neglected. <br> <br>In Mom Life Simulator, every day is a new test of patience, organization, and love. Can you keep everything under control while still finding time for yourself?</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\